@startuml API Query Request Flow
title Public API Query Request Flow

actor Client
participant TimezoneFilter
participant SipsaRestController
participant SipsaReadService
participant PaginationConfig
participant SpecificationBuilder
participant Repository
participant PaginationUtils

== Request Handling ==
Client -> TimezoneFilter: GET /api/sipsa/ciudad?...\nX-Timezone: America/Bogota (optional)
TimezoneFilter -> TimezoneFilter: resolve timezone header
TimezoneFilter -> SipsaRestController: continue filter chain

== Query Execution ==
SipsaRestController -> SipsaReadService: getCiudad(request)
SipsaReadService -> PaginationConfig: buildPageable(page, size, sort)
SipsaReadService -> PaginationConfig: validatePageable(pageable)
SipsaReadService -> PaginationConfig: validateIds(filters)
SipsaReadService -> SpecificationBuilder: build specification
SipsaReadService -> Repository: findAll(spec, pageable)
Repository --> SipsaReadService: Page<Entity>
SipsaReadService -> SipsaReadService: map entities to DTOs
SipsaReadService --> SipsaRestController: Page<Response>
SipsaRestController -> PaginationUtils: toApiResponse(page)
PaginationUtils --> SipsaRestController: ApiResponse

== Response ==
SipsaRestController --> Client: HTTP 200 OK + paginated results

note right of TimezoneFilter
    Resolves X-Timezone and defaults to UTC.
end note

note right of PaginationUtils
    Converts Spring Data pages to the API's 1-based pagination format.
end note

@enduml

